OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fbreezy at times tonight with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain throughout. Becoming cold,
OL,8,Fwith a patchy frost developing across
OL,9,Fwestern parts and over higher ground
OL,10,Flater in the night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy with outbreaks of light
OL,13,Frain possible through the morning, but
OL,14,Fbecoming dry with sunny spells into
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. Rain arriving
OL,16,Fovernight, with snow possible over the
OL,17,FPeak District. Chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
